      "content": "ibuprofen sounds good. how much of it should i take to make sure it actually works for a migraine? i dont want to take too much but i also dont want to be sitting here in pain for hours. also is it okay if i take it on an empty stomach? i haven't eaten anything since breakfast so my stomach is pretty much empty right now.",
